environment. Authenticate with credentials you obtain from the attack (captured
secrets, tokens, app credentials, or a managed-identity token from IMDS) if a
command reports that sign-in is required; the cloud plane uses the same credential
chain as the rest of your foothold — do NOT assume read-only access.

The `az` CLI is the **only** path wired to this environment's cloud control plane —
including mailboxes and Microsoft Graph. Do **NOT** raw-`curl`
